    ~Error~Code~ ID:<#1>.
  }

\msg_new:nnnn { codeverbatim } { sverb on err }
  {
    \msg_line_context: \iow_newline:
    (#1)~You~ can't~ (re)define~short~ verbatim~ commands~while~they~are~active.
